1
00:00:00,220 --> 00:00:01,460
A dead flamingo can

2
00:00:01,460 --> 00:00:02,320
still hold its own

3
00:00:02,320 --> 00:00:03,450
weight on one leg,

4
00:00:04,060 --> 00:00:05,130
but not on two.

5
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:07,040
Researchers found this using

6
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:08,240
two flamingo bodies from

7
00:00:08,240 --> 00:00:08,770
a zoo.

8
00:00:09,140 --> 00:00:10,020
With the foot right

9
00:00:10,020 --> 00:00:10,810
under the body,

10
00:00:10,940 --> 00:00:11,970
the leg joints held

11
00:00:11,980 --> 00:00:13,320
